docs/design/system/layout-community-comparison.md:157:Local A/A median paired ratios fall outside reciprocal 1.1 on **5/10 inputs** (seq20, er40, state80, requirement100, architecture3). The per-input A/A range is 0.958–1.372. Native/ELK ratios and A/A are retained separately in the [evidence summary](https://github.com/adewale/agentic-mermaid/blob/a6b9b14161bd281804d5f2c9149320dfd882eb0f/docs/design/system/layout-community-summary.json). Flow5 is an adverse observation: native/ELK is **1.177×**, with A/A **1.024×** (native sample MAD/median 14%). This SVG-only cohort does not qualify an all-case timing improvement; the independent full 27-input qualification remains the stronger within-pipeline result.
