docs/design/system/pr449-exact-subtraction-2026-10-23.md:39:These numbers are retained descriptive ratios under unhealthy controls, not qualified speedups. They do not qualify an adaptive selector. Two timed observations per input/round give a median equal to their mean; this protocol makes no confidence-interval, p95 or tail-guarantee claim. Allocation/RSS remains unrun after the failed time gate. The parent also completes C2-T standalone delivery explicitly: **4,092,751 raw / 1,227,987 gzip9 bytes**, within unchanged 4,100,000 / 1,260,000 caps. This is source425 delivery evidence; the separately published ec72 raw size remains 4,092,150.
